ShareVaultRequestDepositTest
├── when assets is zero
│   └── it should revert
├── when receiver is the zero address
│   └── it should revert
├── given requests are paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given the vault is stalled
│   └── it should revert
└── given the vault accepts requests
    ├── given the receiver has an older settled deposit
    │   └── it should turn the old deposit into claimable shares
    └── given the receiver has no older deposit
        ├── it should pull the USDC and record it as pending in the current epoch
        └── it should not count a direct transfer as a deposit
